1
00:00:07,231 --> 00:00:15,151
I fumble for the words to say, 
My secrets burning in the dark.

2
00:00:15,891 --> 00:00:23,984
The sofa feels a mile away, 
My body frozen by a spark.

3
00:00:28,825 --> 00:00:41,470
White tiles beneath my shaking knees, 
Cold stone against a burning skin.

4
00:00:45,563 --> 00:00:59,696
Is this the only sanctuary, 
To let the heavy freedom in?

5
00:01:18,135 --> 00:01:22,242
I try to speak, 
the words fall hard,

6
00:01:22,466 --> 00:01:30,511
A heavy shame I cannot hide. 
So lead me through the quiet yard,

7
00:01:30,824 --> 00:01:35,566
Where cold white porcelain waits inside.

8
00:01:37,574 --> 00:01:41,441
Hold me tight, 
don't let me fall,

9
00:01:41,685 --> 00:01:44,961
Beyond the shadow of the wall.

10
00:01:45,945 --> 00:01:54,385
You sit upon my lap so near, 
The tide begins to break the dam.

11
00:02:01,258 --> 00:02:09,040
Washing away the years of fear, 
Showing you rawly who I am.

12
00:02:09,649 --> 00:02:13,658
A sudden wave, 
a fierce release,

13
00:02:13,716 --> 00:02:18,192
For one short moment, 
I find peace.

14
00:02:20,348 --> 00:02:26,361
The sudden warmth begins to chill, 
You stand up straight,

15
00:02:26,401 --> 00:02:30,601
you turn around. 
The room goes dead,

16
00:02:30,671 --> 00:02:37,067
the air stands still, 
Your footsteps leave a hollow sound.

17
00:02:47,664 --> 00:02:55,771
The door is closing with a click, 
Leaving me naked on the brick.

18
00:02:56,204 --> 00:03:04,351
Gasping for air on the cold white floor, 
Reaching my hands through the open door.

19
00:03:06,542 --> 00:03:10,627
The mist is cold, 
the room is bare...

20
00:03:10,859 --> 00:03:20,775
Luna... Luna, where are you?

21
00:03:23,418 --> 00:03:30,760
Luna... Luna...

22
00:03:31,926 --> 00:03:37,175
Luna, where are you?

